==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|careless|ly}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɛɹləsli/|a=GA}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˈkɛələsli/|a=RP}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-carelessly.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Adverb===
{{en-adv}}

# Giving the appearance of [[carelessness]]; [[relaxedly]].
#: {{ux|en|The papers were '''carelessly''' strewn on the table.}}
# Done without care or attention; [[inattentively]].
#: {{ux|en|Distracted by the salesperson, he '''carelessly''' read the contract.}}

